-> ABOUT [node:b286f392-d242-4bc2-86ee-f6c3476c3af4] @ 2026-09-06T11:27:22.460119+00:00

ABOUT reverse carries deliberate weight (0.35) — the only non-zero reverse direction in the edge policy. An entity is the one node class whose purpose is to be walked backwards from; PPR row-normalization keeps a popular hub broadening the bundle rather than swamping it.
