-> ABOUT [node:7e5c85c2-61c8-4061-9631-f3079d4cea25] @ 2026-09-06T11:27:22.462552+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:27:22.462552+00:00

The _migrate_*_check guards are NEWEST-TOKEN checks, not membership checks: every CHECK widening must move its guard to the new newest token, or live stores silently fail to migrate and reject the new value at insert time.
---
