-> HAS_FACET [node:d0b815e4-5f91-4e65-83a2-04444a4d74ca] @ 2026-09-06T11:27:22.465015+00:00

capture_entity never overwrites an existing entity's definition. Disagreement is captured as an artifact with a CONTRADICTS edge so it reaches review; silent redefinition would let any agent move the domain mid-change with no gate.
